<description>&lt;p&gt;Cartel gunmen shot a student bus and a school bus in Sinaloa, targeting civilians, while federal forces seized weapons and a stolen truck from Pacific cartel members in Chiapas. A man killed a dentist over a dispute regarding dental work and then died in a shootout with police. Mexican bishops have urged authorities to search for a missing priest in Sinaloa, and a priest was reported missing in the same state. The United States is offering drone forensics tools to help trace cartel operators in Mexico. There were 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Interior Daily&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Fox News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News - Breaking News, Latest News and Videos&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxNYmZxSG9jS1FTRHZ5SnBNbmpUSUVJbTFHWkRxck92QnRNLWRuaHZXTExyeEJSZllBXy1PSU5VUWNKMHpwdWlEcnRjTXoxWTVzRjFYd1NpZ2VUR3NwdEIydFhSZm12SmpBakJ1UG1HRE96X3RjVzM2dWRINHFTYXdySTN1UDMyVEJiWEZkSHBQcUVHNEk3TEVzdkFzNDRkUTQ3Y0ZjMExB?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News - Breaking News, Latest News and Videos&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News - Breaking News, Latest News and Videos&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;NBC 15 WPMI&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;NST Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Breitbart&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;EIN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxPTXY1emlKb3VqSmVyNE5ocHpBemFSaU4ybnpYdkh0ek5FWVE4QnU5UlMyVmRreTBLVUQxbG9FVEhDczI3cU5YZV9mN29qaDFPVER